WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 22=

22
01:58.365 --> 01:59.446
Tell me the story,

23
02:00.166 --> 02:00.845
Mr. Jiao.

24
02:02.683 --> 02:05.434
(Graduation Photo of Jiangzhou University Law Department Class of 2018)

25
02:09.320 --> 02:12.955
(Five years ago, Jiangzhou)

26
02:14.126 --> 02:15.245
Luo, where are you?

27
02:15.645 --> 02:16.085
I'm here.

28
02:19.846 --> 02:20.205
Thanks.

29
02:25.726 --> 02:26.245
Ms. Weng.

30
02:33.768 --> 02:34.296
(Honey)

31
02:37.672 --> 02:38.424
(Honey)

32
02:46.166 --> 02:46.886
The next day,

33
02:47.365 --> 02:48.166
she arrived

34
02:48.886 --> 02:50.085
at the firm before me.

35
02:51.726 --> 02:52.726
She wanted a divorce,

36
02:53.765 --> 02:54.365
suspecting

37
02:54.406 --> 02:55.639
her husband had a secret kid.

38
02:56.406 --> 02:57.805
But he was good at pretending.

39
02:58.006 --> 02:59.046
He was a perfect husband

40
02:59.085 --> 03:00.006
to friends and family.

41
03:00.245 --> 03:01.805
He was witty, charming, and easygoing.

42
03:02.326 --> 03:03.566
Meanwhile, her mental state

43
03:03.606 --> 03:04.446
was deteriorating,

44
03:04.925 --> 03:06.205
and her family kept nagging her

45
03:06.365 --> 03:08.286
about carelessness and forgetfulness.

46
03:09.685 --> 03:10.726
Weng Xin didn't forget.

47
03:11.925 --> 03:13.085
Han Guang set her up, right?

48
03:13.886 --> 03:14.925
I didn't realize it then,

49
03:17.326 --> 03:18.205
but looking back,

50
03:19.606 --> 03:20.166
he likely did.

51
03:21.166 --> 03:22.245
She was methodical.

52
03:22.726 --> 03:23.765
She bought a new phone

53
03:23.846 --> 03:24.925
and got a new number

54
03:25.525 --> 03:26.726
to make sure our contact

55
03:26.805 --> 03:28.286
stayed completely undetected.

56
03:28.765 --> 03:29.326
And then?

57
03:30.126 --> 03:30.886
That was the end.

58
03:31.286 --> 03:32.525
I was preparing the paperwork.

59
03:32.846 --> 03:33.525
The day before,

60
03:33.566 --> 03:34.645
she happily told me

61
03:34.726 --> 03:36.046
she'd asked for a divorce

62
03:36.205 --> 03:37.166
and could be free.

63
03:38.365 --> 03:39.286
But a few days later...

64
03:39.720 --> 03:41.224
(Five years ago, Jiangzhou)

65
03:43.240 --> 03:45.176
(Weng Xin: Location Sent)

66
04:04.886 --> 04:06.046
I still don't know

67
04:06.085 --> 04:07.485
what happened that night.

68
04:08.645 --> 04:09.485
She was terrified

69
04:09.645 --> 04:10.505
and asked for help.

70
04:11.886 --> 04:12.846
Still, I didn't give up.

71
04:14.566 --> 04:15.710
I kept trying to reach her.

72
04:16.406 --> 04:17.485
Sometimes,

73
04:17.766 --> 04:18.245
she sent me

74
04:18.286 --> 04:19.445
cryptic messages.

75
04:20.125 --> 04:20.966
I tried to guess,

76
04:20.966 --> 04:21.805
but I failed.

77
04:26.606 --> 04:28.236
Did you look for her in her place later?

78
04:28.526 --> 04:29.046
Sure.

79
04:29.606 --> 04:30.694
I even called the police,

80
04:31.005 --> 04:31.925
but she was at home,

81
04:31.966 --> 04:33.086
not missing. No case filed.

82
04:33.966 --> 04:34.805
All I could do was

83
04:34.846 --> 04:35.739
keeping calling her.

84
04:37.125 --> 04:38.166
Then one day...

85
04:41.846 --> 04:42.485
Hello, Ms. Weng?

86
04:43.086 --> 04:44.445
I finally got through to you.

87
04:45.325 --> 04:47.086
This is Han Guang, Weng Xin's husband.

88
04:47.925 --> 04:48.606
Who is this?

89
04:49.925 --> 04:51.086
From that moment on,

90
04:51.766 --> 04:52.445
I knew

91
04:53.365 --> 04:54.646
I'd never reach Weng Xin again.

92
04:56.646 --> 04:58.086
That's why you

93
04:58.286 --> 04:59.365
placed a claw machine here?

94
05:04.526 --> 05:05.885
I wanted to remind myself

95
05:06.526 --> 05:07.365
that no matter how big

96
05:07.365 --> 05:08.005
my wins are,

97
05:08.046 --> 05:08.526
an open case

98
05:08.526 --> 05:09.846
is still hanging over my head.

99
05:12.206 --> 05:13.245
I couldn't let it go.

100
05:14.046 --> 05:14.606
After that,

101
05:15.166 --> 05:16.365
I handled rich girls' divorces

102
05:16.365 --> 05:17.526
from their live-in husbands,

103
05:18.166 --> 05:18.846
doing my best

104
05:18.885 --> 05:20.125
to get close to her circle.

105
05:20.885 --> 05:21.406
And then...

106
05:26.526 --> 05:27.325
Hearing that,

107
05:27.606 --> 05:28.445
I get to understand.

108
05:28.526 --> 05:28.885
Honey.

109
05:29.485 --> 05:29.805
Yes?

110
05:30.005 --> 05:30.846
Say hi to the fans.

111
05:34.125 --> 05:34.685
See?

112
05:35.086 --> 05:36.406
This is our company building.

113
05:42.040 --> 05:45.432
(Lucky Beauty Yu)

114
05:50.885 --> 05:52.125
So back at the bar,

115
05:53.726 --> 05:54.805
you already knew who I was.

116
05:55.005 --> 05:55.365
Yes.

117
05:55.606 --> 05:56.766
So this was all planned

118
05:59.005 --> 06:00.125
from the very beginning.

119
06:04.925 --> 06:05.325
Exactly.

120
06:05.885 --> 06:07.206
That day we flew kites

121
06:07.245 --> 06:08.086
with Chestnut.

122
06:08.885 --> 06:10.056
When I pointed Weng Xin out,

123
06:10.325 --> 06:10.846
why not say

124
06:10.846 --> 06:11.526
you knew her?

125
06:11.885 --> 06:13.166
I couldn't see her like that.

126
06:14.846 --> 06:15.526
And I wanted

127
06:15.565 --> 06:16.685
to stay objective

128
06:17.206 --> 06:18.286
and gather unbiased facts.

129
06:18.966 --> 06:19.526
You could have

130
06:19.526 --> 06:20.206
just told me.

131
06:20.325 --> 06:21.365
Why keep it from me?

132
06:21.485 --> 06:22.606
Back then, our focus

133
06:22.606 --> 06:23.646
wasn't on Han Guang.

134
06:23.885 --> 06:24.685
Telling you

135
06:24.685 --> 06:25.766
would've distracted you.

136
06:26.125 --> 06:27.046
Han Guang and Weng Xin

137
06:27.046 --> 06:27.925
are involved now,

138
06:28.046 --> 06:29.166
and it helps the case.

139
06:29.286 --> 06:30.406
I was ready to tell you.

140
06:32.086 --> 06:32.846
I just hadn't

141
06:32.885 --> 06:33.685
got the right time.

142
06:37.406 --> 06:37.846
Jiao Xu,

143
06:38.445 --> 06:39.846
we've spent tons of time

144
06:40.005 --> 06:41.606
together lately.

145
06:42.166 --> 06:42.726
If you wanted,

146
06:42.726 --> 06:43.966
you could've done it anytime.

147
06:44.406 --> 06:45.365
Also, if you'd told me

148
06:45.365 --> 06:45.846
about her,

149
06:46.325 --> 06:47.565
I could have helped you.

150
06:47.885 --> 06:48.606
By keeping quiet,

151
06:48.846 --> 06:49.445
we missed

152
06:49.445 --> 06:50.606
so many chances

153
06:50.646 --> 06:51.206
to help her.

154
06:52.245 --> 06:53.365
I could have

155
06:53.606 --> 06:54.885
taken the wrong path

156
06:55.086 --> 06:55.685
and made things

157
06:55.685 --> 06:56.805
even worse for all of us.

158
06:57.086 --> 06:58.125
Is that what you wanted,

159
06:58.485 --> 06:59.046
Mr. Jiao?

160
07:06.966 --> 07:07.526
I'm sorry.

161
07:09.966 --> 07:11.166
I didn't think it through.

162
07:13.685 --> 07:14.747
But I didn't deceive you.

163
07:16.606 --> 07:17.646
Not deceiving me?

164
07:18.805 --> 07:19.406
The truth is,

165
07:19.885 --> 07:20.925
you just don't trust me.

166
07:21.086 --> 07:22.606
It's a sore spot for me.

167
07:23.526 --> 07:24.245
Honestly,

168
07:24.925 --> 07:26.046
I'm disappointed in myself,

169
07:26.685 --> 07:27.726
and opening up about it

170
07:30.766 --> 07:31.565
took time.

171
07:33.005 --> 07:34.245
That's still a lack of trust.

172
07:36.526 --> 07:37.166
Like what you

173
07:37.206 --> 07:38.245
told your client earlier,

174
07:38.526 --> 07:39.166
a lawsuit

175
07:39.726 --> 07:40.726
takes mutual trust.

176
07:40.966 --> 07:41.726
It's a two-way choice

177
07:41.726 --> 07:43.406
between client and attorney.

178
07:44.445 --> 07:44.925
I used to

179
07:44.966 --> 07:46.005
trust you 100 percent.

180
07:46.766 --> 07:47.286
Now,

181
07:48.166 --> 07:49.125
I need to reconsider

182
07:49.885 --> 07:51.245
whether to keep you

183
07:51.685 --> 07:52.766
as my divorce attorney.

184
08:07.096 --> 08:09.836
(Attorney Information)

185
08:09.836 --> 08:10.744
(Go, Princess!)

186
08:17.416 --> 08:18.042
(Financial Info)

187
08:18.042 --> 08:19.329
(Call Duration)

188
08:31.368 --> 08:33.144
(Yu Meng)

189
08:36.646 --> 08:37.006
Zi,

190
08:37.725 --> 08:38.445
break this down.

191
08:39.406 --> 08:40.205
Shouldn't he

192
08:40.246 --> 08:41.085
apologize to me?

193
08:41.085 --> 08:42.248
(You)

194
08:45.486 --> 08:45.965
He should.

195
08:46.565 --> 08:47.925
But if you don't let go of me,

196
08:48.085 --> 08:49.725
I'll have to apologize to the guests.

197
08:51.366 --> 08:51.845
Sorry.

198
09:13.006 --> 09:13.925
How's your new job?

199
09:14.565 --> 09:14.965
Tiring?

200
09:15.246 --> 09:16.008
Why are you here?

201
09:18.006 --> 09:18.965
You always forget

202
09:20.325 --> 09:21.325
you can't get rid of me.

203
09:23.246 --> 09:24.845
Haoyu has a flash drive

204
09:25.205 --> 09:26.486
that he copied

205
09:26.565 --> 09:27.126
from Jiao Xu.

206
09:27.605 --> 09:28.886
It has our transfer records.

207
09:30.006 --> 09:31.406
He definitely carries it with him.

208
09:32.126 --> 09:33.126
Find a way to check out.

209
09:34.685 --> 09:35.325
I need to know

210
09:35.685 --> 09:37.046
what they have on us,

211
09:37.486 --> 09:38.126
so I can fix it.

212
09:41.725 --> 09:42.205
What?

213
09:43.085 --> 09:43.805
Food on my face?

214
09:47.565 --> 09:48.246
How time flies.

215
09:48.845 --> 09:49.845
You've grown up so much!

216
09:52.925 --> 09:53.831
My bubble tea is here.

217
09:54.205 --> 09:54.925
Go pick it up.

218
09:55.486 --> 09:56.126
Bubble tea?

219
09:56.845 --> 09:57.286
Since when

220
09:57.286 --> 09:58.246
do you drink bubble tea?

221
09:59.166 --> 10:00.325
I saw you post about it.

222
10:00.766 --> 10:01.526
I want to try it.

223
10:01.725 --> 10:02.565
Okay, I'll go get it.

224
10:32.046 --> 10:32.325
Hello?

225
10:32.526 --> 10:33.006
Mom.

226
10:33.286 --> 10:34.126
Where's the delivery guy?

227
10:34.126 --> 10:34.805
I don't see him.

228
10:35.486 --> 10:36.166
Wait a moment.

229
10:36.886 --> 10:37.925
He said he's almost there.

230
10:38.366 --> 10:38.725
Okay.

231
10:41.046 --> 10:42.246
(Dad, I'm sorry.)

232
10:42.805 --> 10:44.308
(I didn't check Mr. Jiao's computer.)

233
10:44.766 --> 10:45.725
(You must know)

234
10:46.006 --> 10:46.685
(that even if I)

235
10:46.725 --> 10:47.725
(wiped his hard drive,)

236
10:48.205 --> 10:49.126
(he'd still)

237
10:49.126 --> 10:49.845
(have backups.)

238
10:50.565 --> 10:51.886
(It would all be pointless.)

239
10:52.646 --> 10:53.805
(I didn't mean to lie.)

240
10:54.286 --> 10:55.366
(Since I came back,)

241
10:55.486 --> 10:56.246
(I've realized)

242
10:56.286 --> 10:57.406
(you're not the same.)

243
10:58.246 --> 10:59.565
(Not like the dad I remember.)

244
11:00.246 --> 11:01.445
(Don't get me wrong.)

245
11:01.886 --> 11:02.725
(I mean,)

246
11:03.046 --> 11:04.486
(you look sharper and younger,)

247
11:05.126 --> 11:06.805
(but you also look a bit strange)

248
11:07.085 --> 11:07.685
(to me.)

249
11:08.725 --> 11:09.565
(Still,)

250
11:10.166 --> 11:11.006
(you're my dad.)

251
11:11.845 --> 11:13.166
(I don't know how much you took,)

252
11:13.646 --> 11:14.725
(but I can give you)

253
11:14.725 --> 11:15.355
(all my money.)

254
11:15.725 --> 11:16.805
(Please pay Meng back)

255
11:17.166 --> 11:18.286
(and just let it all go.)

256
11:19.006 --> 11:19.565
(Please?)

257
11:20.526 --> 11:21.965
(I don't want you in prison.)

258
11:22.325 --> 11:23.126
(I'm an adult now.)

259
11:23.406 --> 11:24.085
(I can earn money)

260
11:24.085 --> 11:25.126
(and get student loans.)

261
11:25.445 --> 11:26.646
(Our lives won't change.)

262
11:27.605 --> 11:28.501
(When I was little,)

263
11:28.565 --> 11:29.886
(you snuck me out for skewers,)

264
11:30.766 --> 11:31.766
(hiding it from Mom.)

265
11:32.685 --> 11:33.565
(Let's fix it together)

266
11:33.565 --> 11:34.166
(this time.)

267
11:35.325 --> 11:36.249
(Don't let Mom know.)

268
11:36.925 --> 11:37.366
(Please.)

269
11:59.526 --> 12:01.205
Bubble tea is here!

270
12:03.006 --> 12:03.925
I ordered two flavors.

271
12:04.166 --> 12:04.965
Pick what you like.

272
12:05.925 --> 12:06.766
Either's fine.

273
12:07.845 --> 12:08.366
You first.

274
12:09.286 --> 12:10.685
Stop always putting others first,

275
12:11.126 --> 12:11.646
including me.

276
12:12.046 --> 12:12.725
Everyone can

277
12:12.725 --> 12:13.741
take care of themselves.

278
12:14.006 --> 12:14.805
You just

279
12:14.845 --> 12:15.685
focus on yourself.

280
12:15.805 --> 12:16.205
Got it?

281
12:18.366 --> 12:18.845
I got it.

282
12:26.366 --> 12:26.886
Then...

283
12:27.685 --> 12:28.486
I'll take this one.

284
12:30.725 --> 12:31.046
Here.

285
12:38.246 --> 12:38.565
Mom,

286
12:38.925 --> 12:40.685
hasn't it been a while

287
12:40.685 --> 12:41.685
since we ate with Dad?

288
12:41.925 --> 12:42.886
I saw him the other day.

289
12:42.886 --> 12:43.366
He said

290
12:43.965 --> 12:44.766
we could have a meal

291
12:44.805 --> 12:45.366
together soon.

292
12:47.166 --> 12:47.565
Sure.

293
12:59.766 --> 13:00.627
(Found flash drive?)

294
13:03.886 --> 13:04.646
(No.)

295
13:05.166 --> 13:06.035
(He didn't bring it.)

296
13:12.845 --> 13:13.486
(At 2 PM,)

297
13:14.166 --> 13:15.565
(see you at wellness center's parking lot.)

298
13:23.006 --> 13:24.193
I'll take you inside today,

299
13:24.406 --> 13:24.925
so you can

300
13:24.925 --> 13:25.965
talk to Weng Xin.

301
13:27.445 --> 13:28.486
Didn't you say before

302
13:28.685 --> 13:29.486
it was too risky?

303
13:30.166 --> 13:31.286
Without the money,

304
13:31.565 --> 13:32.766
Liren won't get your shares.

305
13:33.366 --> 13:34.246
Who knows what he'd do

306
13:34.325 --> 13:35.286
on impulse?

307
13:36.205 --> 13:37.325
We should take some risks

308
13:37.526 --> 13:38.725
and resolve this quickly.

309
13:40.286 --> 13:41.286
I thought you'd come

310
13:41.725 --> 13:42.925
with Jiao Xu.

311
13:45.766 --> 13:46.805
I think

312
13:47.126 --> 13:48.046
coming alone

313
13:48.246 --> 13:49.212
draws less attention.

314
14:25.805 --> 14:26.366
Weng Xin,

315
14:27.325 --> 14:28.085
do you remember me?

316
14:34.526 --> 14:35.166
I do.

317
14:36.526 --> 14:37.246
I came today

318
14:37.325 --> 14:38.325
to bring you a book.

319
14:38.685 --> 14:39.205
Weng Yue said

320
14:39.205 --> 14:40.126
it was your favorite.

321
14:40.286 --> 14:41.286
It inspired you

322
14:41.766 --> 14:43.046
to become a lawyer.

323
14:43.805 --> 14:44.366
Remember?

324
14:48.648 --> 14:54.748
(Rage of Angels)

325
14:56.366 --> 14:57.605
My memory is awful,

326
14:59.366 --> 15:00.766
and I read really slowly.

327
15:02.526 --> 15:03.526
Are you sure you want

328
15:03.646 --> 15:04.486
to lend it to me?

329
15:05.006 --> 15:05.605
Of course.

330
15:06.286 --> 15:07.565
This book is a gift for you.

331
15:09.486 --> 15:10.126
Thank you.

332
15:14.205 --> 15:14.805
Weng Xin,

333
15:15.725 --> 15:16.486
all good

334
15:16.886 --> 15:17.766
here?

335
15:22.046 --> 15:22.605
Yeah.

336
15:24.286 --> 15:25.406
I'll come visit you again

337
15:25.845 --> 15:26.565
in a few days.

338
15:31.246 --> 15:31.805
Weng Xin,

339
15:32.685 --> 15:33.526
where does your son

340
15:33.766 --> 15:34.605
go to school?

341
15:34.965 --> 15:35.565
New York.

342
15:36.246 --> 15:36.845
New York?

343
15:39.886 --> 15:40.406
Are you sure?

344
15:43.766 --> 15:44.366
Yes.

345
15:45.605 --> 15:46.126
New York.

346
15:46.605 --> 15:47.366
It's New York.

347
15:47.886 --> 15:48.886
It's definitely New York.

348
15:49.286 --> 15:50.565
Weng Xin, I believe you.

349
15:50.685 --> 15:51.366
I believe you.

350
15:51.445 --> 15:52.725
I believe you.

351
15:52.845 --> 15:53.366
I really do.

352
15:57.286 --> 15:57.805
Hello?

353
15:58.246 --> 15:59.406
Come out, hurry!

354
15:59.646 --> 16:00.401
Han Guang is here.

355
16:02.925 --> 16:03.886
Visiting Xin again?

356
16:04.845 --> 16:05.605
How is she today?

357
16:05.766 --> 16:06.246
Pretty good.

358
16:06.766 --> 16:07.925
She had a visitor today.

359
16:15.205 --> 16:15.695
Han Guang.

360
16:15.766 --> 16:16.486
Wait, Han Guang.

361
16:17.006 --> 16:17.747
Why are you here?

362
16:19.126 --> 16:20.246
I brought Xin something.

363
16:20.406 --> 16:21.359
They're in the trunk.

364
16:21.805 --> 16:23.166
Can you help me get them?

365
16:23.526 --> 16:24.246
They're too heavy

366
16:24.805 --> 16:25.406
for me.

367
16:46.406 --> 16:47.205
Weng Yue stalled him

368
16:47.205 --> 16:47.725
for now.

369
16:48.006 --> 16:49.085
Guest restroom is up ahead.

370
16:49.085 --> 16:49.965
Go wait inside.

371
16:50.246 --> 16:51.246
I'll fix the visitor log.

372
16:52.685 --> 16:53.085
Wait.

373
16:54.006 --> 16:54.406
Ms. Hui,

374
16:54.845 --> 16:55.406
I just

375
16:55.766 --> 16:56.565
had an idea.

376
16:58.246 --> 16:59.364
How come there's a visitor?

377
16:59.886 --> 17:01.126
Didn't I make it clear

378
17:01.286 --> 17:02.286
no outsiders are allowed

379
17:02.325 --> 17:03.246
to visit her?

380
17:07.926 --> 17:08.565
I don't know.

381
17:11.446 --> 17:12.006
It was me.

382
17:19.926 --> 17:21.286
Ms. Yu? What are you doing here?

383
17:22.325 --> 17:23.085
I came to see you.

384
17:23.926 --> 17:24.526
See me?

385
17:31.966 --> 17:32.686
What an honor.

386
17:32.926 --> 17:33.805
You came all this way

387
17:33.845 --> 17:34.686
just to see me?

388
17:35.486 --> 17:36.286
What is it?

389
17:36.526 --> 17:37.325
About my divorce

390
17:37.405 --> 17:38.405
from Di Liren,

391
17:38.766 --> 17:40.006
I'm sure you already heard.

392
17:40.885 --> 17:41.565
You

393
17:41.645 --> 17:42.966
leaked that news yourself, right?

394
17:43.966 --> 17:45.686
To stop him from using the Yu name

395
17:45.766 --> 17:46.805
to raise funds,

396
17:46.926 --> 17:48.325
borrow money,

397
17:48.405 --> 17:49.885
and come after your shares.

398
17:50.405 --> 17:50.845
Exactly.

399
17:51.325 --> 17:52.365
So I want to work with you

400
17:52.645 --> 17:53.845
and cut him off completely.

401
17:53.966 --> 17:55.125
Why should I help you?

402
17:56.805 --> 17:57.565
You'll help us.

403
18:02.845 --> 18:03.686
Why are you here?

404
18:06.486 --> 18:07.165
The two of you...

405
18:11.206 --> 18:12.206
Does Di Liren know?

406
18:13.726 --> 18:15.325
Why ruin

407
18:15.805 --> 18:16.605
such a nice surprise

408
18:16.605 --> 18:17.365
this early?

409
18:18.446 --> 18:18.885
Mr. Han,

410
18:19.605 --> 18:20.645
I'll do the math for you.

411
18:21.246 --> 18:22.645
Though you hold more shares

412
18:22.766 --> 18:23.845
than Di Liren,

413
18:24.325 --> 18:25.325
if he takes my 25 percent

414
18:25.365 --> 18:26.766
of the shares,

415
18:26.916 --> 18:28.246
and assumes the role

416
18:28.325 --> 18:29.046
of Chairman,

417
18:29.565 --> 18:30.686
you will be

418
18:30.805 --> 18:32.125
in a tough spot at Jiali.

419
18:32.325 --> 18:33.165
For instance,

420
18:33.365 --> 18:34.446
he'd reject any candidates

421
18:34.605 --> 18:35.926
you put forward, no doubt.

422
18:36.085 --> 18:37.405
This tug-of-war

423
18:37.605 --> 18:38.966
will only waste precious time.

424
18:39.405 --> 18:40.165
If I push him out

425
18:40.686 --> 18:41.686
and leave you at Jiali,

426
18:42.125 --> 18:43.125
I'll still be stuck.

427
18:45.286 --> 18:46.286
Don't tell me

428
18:46.405 --> 18:47.805
you can't handle me, Mr. Han?

429
18:48.365 --> 18:48.726
I'm not

430
18:48.766 --> 18:49.766
that career-driven.

431
18:51.325 --> 18:52.286
Drop the act.

432
18:52.726 --> 18:54.565
You're much trickier than Di Liren.

433
18:55.085 --> 18:55.926
Fine. Tell me.

434
18:56.605 --> 18:57.365
If I help you,

435
18:57.926 --> 18:59.006
what's in it for me?

436
19:00.605 --> 19:01.246
Nothing.

437
19:03.006 --> 19:03.405
Wait.

438
19:04.165 --> 19:06.486
There is one huge benefit.

439
19:07.526 --> 19:08.446
The two of us

440
19:08.565 --> 19:09.726
will keep a big secret safe

441
19:09.885 --> 19:10.766
for you.

442
19:11.125 --> 19:12.125
Who would've thought

443
19:12.726 --> 19:14.206
that someone as meticulous

444
19:14.325 --> 19:15.405
as Mr. Han would

445
19:16.125 --> 19:16.966
stash his own son

446
19:17.085 --> 19:17.805
in New York,

447
19:18.006 --> 19:19.325
using business trips as cover

448
19:19.446 --> 19:20.565
every time to visit him?

449
19:21.405 --> 19:23.206
Convenient and safe, isn't it?

450
19:24.966 --> 19:25.726
What nonsense.

451
19:26.165 --> 19:27.365
Did we not make it clear?

452
19:27.645 --> 19:29.165
Do you need more details?

453
19:30.206 --> 19:31.206
But these rooms

454
19:31.605 --> 19:32.605
aren't very soundproof.

455
19:34.486 --> 19:35.805
You think this gives you leverage

456
19:36.565 --> 19:37.486
over me?

457
19:38.286 --> 19:39.046
Of course not.

458
19:39.726 --> 19:40.845
Consider it an appetizer,

459
19:41.365 --> 19:43.405
like taking someone out to dinner.

460
19:43.645 --> 19:44.766
You serve the bread first,

461
19:44.805 --> 19:46.446
and then the main courses follow.

462
19:49.085 --> 19:50.446
Could it be that you're eager

463
19:50.926 --> 19:51.446
for what

464
19:51.526 --> 19:52.926
comes next, Mr. Han?

465
20:04.365 --> 20:05.085
I understand

466
20:05.405 --> 20:06.686
why you want Di Liren out,

467
20:06.686 --> 20:07.286
Ms. Yu.

468
20:08.206 --> 20:08.845
What about you?

469
20:09.365 --> 20:10.526
Why are you getting involved?

470
20:11.046 --> 20:12.085
I need a favor of you

471
20:12.165 --> 20:12.966
as well.

472
20:33.446 --> 20:34.286
You scared me.

473
20:35.085 --> 20:36.566
If you have no guilty conscience,

474
20:36.766 --> 20:37.365
why panic?

475
20:38.246 --> 20:39.766
My biggest guilty conscience

476
20:40.006 --> 20:41.006
is upsetting my client,

477
20:41.085 --> 20:41.966
Ms. Yu.

478
20:48.605 --> 20:49.526
Are you done being mad?

479
20:49.926 --> 20:50.706
Not your business.

480
20:51.686 --> 20:53.165
Then why did you come looking for me

481
20:53.526 --> 20:54.365
all of a sudden?

482
20:54.605 --> 20:55.766
You're my lawyer.

483
20:55.926 --> 20:57.006
You work for me.

484
20:57.766 --> 20:58.605
That's a relief.

485
20:59.286 --> 20:59.885
I thought

486
20:59.926 --> 21:00.885
you would fire me.

487
21:03.325 --> 21:04.493
I visited the wellness center

488
21:04.966 --> 21:06.010
and ran into Han Guang.

489
21:07.885 --> 21:08.966
He was visiting Weng Xin.

490
21:09.486 --> 21:10.526
Since hiding

491
21:10.805 --> 21:12.085
might've exposed me anyway,

492
21:13.006 --> 21:13.885
Lu Hui and I just

493
21:14.286 --> 21:15.405
confronted him directly.

494
21:16.125 --> 21:17.006
We reached a deal.

495
21:17.805 --> 21:18.926
He won't help Di Liren

496
21:19.046 --> 21:19.926
frame Lu Hui and me,

497
21:20.405 --> 21:21.286
and in return,

498
21:21.446 --> 21:22.845
we won't tell the Weng family

499
21:23.085 --> 21:24.365
about his illegitimate child

500
21:24.645 --> 21:25.286
abroad.

501
21:25.605 --> 21:26.645
You found actual proof

502
21:26.726 --> 21:27.446
about this child?

503
21:29.845 --> 21:31.645
Not yet.

504
21:32.246 --> 21:33.206
All is fair in war,

505
21:33.645 --> 21:34.526
especially when

506
21:34.565 --> 21:35.885
fixing a sly guy like Han Guang.

507
21:35.885 --> 21:37.165
I suspect

508
21:37.526 --> 21:39.246
he thinks Weng Xin has lost her mind,

509
21:39.405 --> 21:40.405
so he talks explicitly

510
21:40.405 --> 21:41.125
in front of her.

511
21:42.605 --> 21:43.686
She probably overheard bits

512
21:43.805 --> 21:45.030
about the illegitimate child,

513
21:45.565 --> 21:46.605
became confused,

514
21:46.966 --> 21:48.286
and assumed the child was hers.

515
21:49.805 --> 21:50.405
Actually,

516
21:52.286 --> 21:53.686
you don't need to get involved.

517
21:54.405 --> 21:55.046
Why not?

518
21:56.325 --> 21:58.085
Aren't you the one who wanted to help her?

519
21:58.206 --> 21:59.046
I mean

520
21:59.805 --> 22:00.565
you just focus

521
22:00.686 --> 22:01.645
on your own case.

522
22:02.365 --> 22:02.885
I know

523
22:03.926 --> 22:05.645
seeing her reminds you of yourself.

524
22:05.885 --> 22:06.486
It scares you

525
22:07.085 --> 22:07.766
that you nearly

526
22:07.805 --> 22:08.565
ended up like her.

527
22:09.246 --> 22:09.605
But

528
22:10.365 --> 22:11.125
until we

529
22:11.246 --> 22:12.365
get proof against Han Guang,

530
22:12.686 --> 22:13.966
neither of us can help her.

531
22:14.046 --> 22:14.885
So for now,

532
22:15.446 --> 22:16.726
let me fix your problems first.

533
22:25.165 --> 22:25.805
Hello?

534
22:26.686 --> 22:27.486
Is this Yu Meng?

535
22:28.325 --> 22:29.885
This is Jiangzhou Hospital ER.

536
22:30.405 --> 22:31.805
Do you know Fang Haoyu?

537
22:35.085 --> 22:35.565
Meng.

538
22:36.246 --> 22:36.645
Meng.

539
22:39.206 --> 22:39.645
Harry!

540
22:40.286 --> 22:40.845
What happened?

541
22:41.006 --> 22:42.165
Why did it suddenly relapse?

542
22:42.526 --> 22:43.246
Don't panic.

543
22:43.486 --> 22:44.246
I'll call your mom.

544
22:44.365 --> 22:44.805
Don't.

545
22:45.605 --> 22:46.446
Don't let her know.

546
22:47.405 --> 22:48.246
This is serious.

547
22:48.645 --> 22:49.726
Don't be stubborn.

548
22:50.885 --> 22:51.766
It's not a relapse.

549
22:52.085 --> 22:52.726
I was just

550
22:53.526 --> 22:54.365
feeling unwell.

551
22:57.645 --> 22:58.325
Test results?

552
22:58.486 --> 22:59.006
Let me see.

553
23:02.645 --> 23:03.006
Here.

554
23:07.726 --> 23:09.766
The doctor said it's just my heart rate.

555
23:10.125 --> 23:11.006
I just need rest.

556
23:11.966 --> 23:13.165
I don't want to be here.

557
23:13.605 --> 23:14.365
Can I crash

558
23:14.446 --> 23:15.526
at the club for a while?

559
23:15.966 --> 23:16.605
(Registration Form) I can sleep on the couch.

560
23:19.325 --> 23:20.165
You faked sick?

561
23:22.405 --> 23:23.526
I... I didn't fake it.

562
23:23.605 --> 23:24.565
You booked this

563
23:24.645 --> 23:25.365
online in advance.

564
23:25.526 --> 23:26.645
You weren't rushed to the ER

565
23:26.645 --> 23:27.686
with a sudden attack.

566
23:32.325 --> 23:32.726
I just

567
23:32.726 --> 23:33.726
wanted to talk to you.

568
23:33.885 --> 23:34.645
I had no choice.

569
23:34.645 --> 23:35.565
This was the only way

570
23:36.206 --> 23:37.446
I could see you.

571
23:39.645 --> 23:41.286
My dad isn't a good husband.

572
23:42.405 --> 23:43.286
To the company,

573
23:44.446 --> 23:45.165
he isn't even

574
23:45.165 --> 23:45.805
a good chairman.

575
23:46.325 --> 23:47.006
But he is

576
23:47.046 --> 23:47.926
a truly good father.

577
23:48.446 --> 23:49.246
(I can't abandon him.)

578
23:49.246 --> 23:50.605
(Ten years ago, Xiaocheng)

579
23:50.605 --> 23:51.565
(I was born sick.)

580
23:52.726 --> 23:54.046
(If he hadn't worked two jobs)

581
23:54.645 --> 23:56.085
(and ran side businesses,)

582
23:56.766 --> 23:57.286
(trying)

583
23:57.446 --> 23:58.605
(to make money,)

584
23:59.885 --> 24:00.633
(I would've died.)

585
24:01.686 --> 24:02.486
Tetralogy of Fallot

586
24:02.486 --> 24:03.526
is so complicated

587
24:04.325 --> 24:05.726
that it takes multiple surgeries

588
24:06.206 --> 24:06.926
to cure.

589
24:07.726 --> 24:09.046
One can't skip a single one.

590
24:09.605 --> 24:10.446
(When I was 15,)

591
24:10.446 --> 24:11.565
(Five years ago, Xiaocheng)

592
24:11.565 --> 24:12.365
(I was in grave danger)

593
24:12.365 --> 24:13.125
(once again.)

594
24:15.165 --> 24:16.472
(Though they kept it from me,)

595
24:17.365 --> 24:17.966
(I still heard)

596
24:17.966 --> 24:19.206
(from my relatives)

597
24:20.805 --> 24:21.976
(that the surgery would cost)

598
24:23.085 --> 24:23.565
(300,000.)

599
24:25.845 --> 24:26.686
(Later I learned)

600
24:27.165 --> 24:27.966
(he even considered)

601
24:28.446 --> 24:29.446
(selling his kidney)

602
24:29.446 --> 24:30.195
(or other organs.)

603
24:31.365 --> 24:32.290
(He didn't know how,)

604
24:32.726 --> 24:33.565
(or he would have.)

605
24:34.286 --> 24:34.845
They should

606
24:34.926 --> 24:35.805
have had better lives.

607
24:36.926 --> 24:37.805
If they hadn't had me,

608
24:39.605 --> 24:40.085
they would

609
24:40.085 --> 24:40.885
be better off.

610
24:42.286 --> 24:43.046
Right around then,

611
24:44.125 --> 24:45.405
my dad borrowed the money,

612
24:46.165 --> 24:47.046
300 thousand yuan.

613
24:47.486 --> 24:48.353
(I had the surgery,)

614
24:49.165 --> 24:50.605
(and things finally turned around.)

615
24:51.165 --> 24:52.085
(I recovered,)

616
24:52.926 --> 24:54.365
(and Mom sent me abroad to study.)

617
24:55.286 --> 24:55.973
(It felt like)

618
24:56.246 --> 24:57.645
(we'd survived the test of fate)

619
24:58.286 --> 24:59.526
(and crawled out of the abyss.)

620
25:00.125 --> 25:00.966
Now I know

621
25:02.885 --> 25:04.046
that money came from you.

622
25:04.726 --> 25:05.125
Meng,

623
25:06.125 --> 25:06.885
give me some time.

624
25:07.645 --> 25:08.325
I'll persuade him

625
25:09.046 --> 25:09.645
to give up.

626
25:10.486 --> 25:11.046
I will

627
25:11.405 --> 25:11.908
convince him

628
25:11.966 --> 25:13.365
to sign the divorce right away

629
25:13.486 --> 25:14.766
and pay back what he owes Jiali.

630
25:15.446 --> 25:15.845
Please.

631
25:17.206 --> 25:17.686
Harry,

632
25:19.046 --> 25:20.286
do you still expect your family

633
25:21.605 --> 25:22.966
to go back to how it used to be?

634
25:25.845 --> 25:26.325
I...

635
25:26.926 --> 25:28.206
All I want now is

636
25:30.046 --> 25:31.165
to keep him out of prison.

637
25:33.686 --> 25:34.246
Meng,

638
25:36.726 --> 25:37.446
I'm begging you.

639
25:40.446 --> 25:41.645
He has to pay

640
25:42.885 --> 25:44.165
for what he has done.

641
25:49.766 --> 25:50.325
By the way,

642
25:51.486 --> 25:53.006
the money for your surgery

643
25:53.446 --> 25:54.805
was borrowed from my father.

644
25:55.286 --> 25:55.766
Back then,

645
25:55.766 --> 25:56.726
we weren't even dating.

646
25:57.165 --> 25:58.446
And he paid it back quickly.

647
25:59.766 --> 26:00.246
Really?

648
26:01.006 --> 26:01.885
Just stating facts.

649
26:02.526 --> 26:03.486
I have no reason to lie.

650
26:08.392 --> 26:11.605
(Wu Ta Club)

651
26:11.605 --> 26:12.125
What's wrong?

652
26:16.805 --> 26:17.365
Nothing.

653
26:18.006 --> 26:18.833
Harry talked to me

654
26:19.286 --> 26:20.046
about Di Liren.

655
26:20.805 --> 26:21.605
Hard to decide?

656
26:24.726 --> 26:25.845
When it comes to Di Liren,

657
26:26.085 --> 26:26.686
you can decide

658
26:26.726 --> 26:27.645
without fear.

659
26:28.085 --> 26:29.085
I'll be your safety net.

660
26:34.565 --> 26:34.966
Since I am

661
26:35.006 --> 26:36.206
so understanding,

662
26:36.405 --> 26:37.006
a task for you.

663
26:37.365 --> 26:38.295
Count down 15 seconds.

664
26:40.165 --> 26:41.286
15-second countdown?

665
26:41.885 --> 26:42.325
Why?

666
26:43.405 --> 26:43.845
Ten.

667
26:45.286 --> 26:45.726
Nine.

668
26:47.405 --> 26:47.805
Eight.

669
26:48.926 --> 26:49.405
Seven.

670
26:49.766 --> 26:50.206
Six.

671
26:51.085 --> 26:51.645
Five.

672
26:52.365 --> 26:52.885
Four.

673
26:53.766 --> 26:54.365
Three.

674
26:54.926 --> 26:55.645
Two.

675
26:56.246 --> 26:56.805
One.

676
26:57.365 --> 26:59.805
Happy birthday!

677
27:00.405 --> 27:00.926
Thank you.

678
27:01.926 --> 27:02.365
My cake?

679
27:06.805 --> 27:07.325
Hold on.

680
27:09.416 --> 27:14.279
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

681
27:14.805 --> 27:15.085
Here.

682
27:16.125 --> 27:16.685
Your cake.

683
27:16.966 --> 27:17.605
Seriously?

684
27:17.966 --> 27:18.966
I have never received

685
27:19.125 --> 27:20.125
such a half-hearted cake.

686
27:23.085 --> 27:23.446
Fine.

687
27:23.726 --> 27:24.325
Then

688
27:24.766 --> 27:25.686
give me another chance.

689
27:27.286 --> 27:27.726
Yu Meng,

690
27:28.605 --> 27:29.206
happy birthday.

691
27:31.261 --> 27:37.645
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

692
27:37.645 --> 27:38.325
May you always

693
27:38.325 --> 27:39.565
stand in the brightest light,

694
27:40.006 --> 27:40.766
with the sunshine,

695
27:41.325 --> 27:42.165
just like you did.

696
27:44.325 --> 27:44.845
Thank you.

697
27:45.845 --> 27:46.405
Meng,

698
27:48.325 --> 27:48.966
happy birthday.

699
27:50.446 --> 27:51.885
Thanks.

700
27:55.645 --> 27:56.314
Make a wish.

